cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software supports your research, please cite it."
title: "openalex-mcp: an MCP server for the OpenAlex API"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol stdio server exposing OpenAlex (OurResearch) as eight tools for
  works, authors, sources and citation relations. Every query can be deposited to
  an append-only, hash-chained receipt ledger. Part of a family of bibliographic
  MCP servers sharing one vendored ledger module.
type: software
